{"id":"vod_sn_37753","vodId":"37753","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"纯情罗曼史第三季","name_cn":"纯情罗曼史第三季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/65ced56ccb06d874095aa5e1398fba31.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《纯情罗曼史3》改编自日本漫画家中村春菊原作的漫画《纯情罗曼史》，亦是该系列动画的第3期，剧情从原作第11卷讲起。《纯情罗曼史》动画第3期制作的消息在2014年8月发售的单行本第18卷上公布。电视动画于2015年7月8日在日本播出，在中国大陆的网络播放权由腾讯视频取得。在哥哥的朋友、超有名的小说家（兼BL小说家）宇佐见秋彦以家庭教师身份的帮助之下，高桥美咲顺利地成为了大学生。美咲借着哥哥转职的机会寄住到宇佐见的公寓，在同居的过程中，他自觉到自己与宇佐见的关系，以及对于宇佐见感情的变化。某天，美咲得知自己总算升到了大学四年级而感到高兴，但转眼间他就迎来了更进一步的试练。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RG9zLdtqJQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LEQK5UH10a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dijznYM5mM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uA062g12ya1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yiCTF5TKfr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DSHY0KrBsH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f29J7JCaXV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MSxbLnH8ap1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fRifwBv0zH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EZ2Ahps5WQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zet6JeeZVx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MDnvGjfmvt1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:07.121Z"}